rs+end+up+buying+a+bigger+box+within+a+month+anyway.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhich+Box+Should+You+Buy%3F%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cfigure+class%3D%22wp-block-table%22%3E%3Ctable%3E%3Cthead%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Cth%3EYour+situation%3C%2Fth%3E%3Cth%3EBuy%3C%2Fth%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Fthead%3E%3Ctbody%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECommitted%2C+want+a+real+army+from+day+one%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EUltimate+Starter+Set%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3ECurious%2C+want+a+proper+taste%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EStarter+Set%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EGift%2C+budget+cap%2C+or+%22just+trying+it%22%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3E%3Cstrong%3EIntroductory+Set%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3Ctr%3E%3Ctd%3EYou+already+know+you+want+Necrons+or+Marines+only%3C%2Ftd%3E%3Ctd%3EStarter+box+%2B+a+%3Cstrong%3ECombat+Patrol%3C%2Fstrong%3E+box+of+your+chosen+faction%3C%2Ftd%3E%3C%2Ftr%3E%3C%2Ftbody%3E%3C%2Ftable%3E%3C%2Ffigure%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EWhat+You+DON%27T+Need+Yet%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3EBeginners+overspend+on+things+that+don%27t+matter+in+month+one%3A%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ECodex+army+books%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+starter+rules+cover+your+models%3B+codices+matter+at+1%2C000%2B+points%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EA+full+paint+range%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+3%E2%80%934+pots+plus+a+wash+is+plenty%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3ETerrain%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+books%2C+boxes+and+mugs+make+fine+obstacles+for+your+first+games%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%3Cstrong%3EA+second+army%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+the+starter+box+already+includes+two+sides%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3C%2Ful%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EFAQ+%E2%80%94+Warhammer+40K+Starter+Sets%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EWhat+is+the+best+Warhammer+40K+starter+set+for+beginners%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EThe+Ultimate+Starter+Set.+It%27s+the+only+box+that+includes+two+genuinely+playable+mini-armies+plus+the+full+rules%2C+dice+and+mission+deck+%E2%80%94+a+complete+hobby+start+in+one+purchase.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EIs+the+smaller+starter+set+worth+it%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes%2C+if+you%27re+unsure+about+the+hobby+or+buying+as+a+gift.+It+teaches+assembly%2C+painting+and+basic+play+for+the+lowest+price.+Expect+to+upgrade+within+weeks+if+you+get+hooked.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+starter+boxes+include+paints%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3ETypically+no+%E2%80%94+paints+are+sold+separately+or+in+hobby+bundles.+Budget+%2430%E2%80%9340+for+side+cutters%2C+glue+%28if+needed%29%2C+primer+and+3%E2%80%934+paint+pots.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3ECan+I+play+a+real+game+with+just+a+starter+box%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EYes.+The+bigger+boxes+give+you+legal+forces+for+500-point+games+out+of+the+box%2C+which+is+exactly+the+size+beginners+should+be+playing+anyway.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EShould+I+buy+a+Combat+Patrol+box+instead+of+a+starter+set%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EIf+you+already+know+which+faction+you+want+and+someone+can+teach+you+the+rules%2C+a+Combat+Patrol+box+plus+the+free+core+rules+is+a+great+direct+route.+For+most+true+beginners%2C+the+starter+box+is+the+better+teacher.%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3E%3Cstrong%3EDo+starter+box+models+count+toward+a+real+army%3F%3C%2Fstrong%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Cp%3EAbsolutely+%E2%80%94+every+model+in+a+starter+box+is+a+full+legal+unit+you%27ll+keep+using+for+years.+Nothing+in+a+starter+box+is+%22disposable.%22%3C%2Fp%3E%0A%3Ch2%3EGet+Your+Box+and+Start%3C%2Fh2%3E%0A%3Cul%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fhow-to-start-warhammer-40k%2F%22%3EHow+to+Start+Warhammer+40K%3A+Beginner%27s+Roadmap%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+your+first+30+days%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fbest-warhammer-40k-army-for-beginners%2F%22%3EBest+Warhammer+40K+Army+for+Beginners%3C%2Fa%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E+%E2%80%94+Marines+vs.+Necrons%3C%2Fli%3E%0A%3Cli%3E%F0%9F%91%89+%3Cstrong%3E%3Ca+href%3D%22%2Fspace-marines-beginner-army-guide%2F%22%3ESpace+Marines+Beginner+Army+Guide%3C%2Fa%3E%